<span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">ID: ER-391</span>
</div>
<h3 class="text-lg font-bold leading-tight text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">Competitor Pricing Strategy</h3>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-end">
<span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 mb-1">Impact</span>
<span class="text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 font-bold text-lg">+5%</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mb-4">
<p class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 truncate">
                        Confirm SaaS tier pricing for Q4 Enterprise...
                    </p>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex -space-x-2 overflow-visible">
<img alt="User avatar" class="inline-block h-6 w-6 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white dark:ring-card-dark object-cover grayscale opacity-70" data-alt="Portrait of a man in glasses" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBX1ns_VItp8LNRoa5PAieCH3OTGJDiwqlLvKGZo8aG41n_zd8CuL3wrvAIAENCx8R2182vS_UGLczRSlp0yR2s32fKcMbXyXfveqqWUasBYk_B2AipenWNg5OCFgaXZN79rNcx8RSDsJ7Dgmh4oadOlgSTDxJDX7X5Hz2zTQybNt-LgxRUuDTNF1Z-EpuseMRDpV6JClUMyv5ypXQk4oxHnf1uWJHuGXGWK80poK-e6OVylzygeD73UjdXNkf5SC9WTtmDp83oIQ8"/>
</div>
